-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MIT license above covers code of Web FastLED itself (page, scripts, service
worker, Arduino core for WebAssembly in runtime/core, build tools, tests).
Components below are distributed with it under their own licenses; their full
texts come with their sources.

FastLED 3.7.8
  Daniel Garcia, Mark Kriegsman and contributors. MIT license.
  https://github.com/FastLED/FastLED
  Used in WebAssembly SDK (stub platform: clockless_stub.h, led_sysdefs_stub.h
  patched) and in real build for AVR.

Arduino AVR core 1.8.6, libraries SPI, Wire, SoftwareSerial, EEPROM
  Arduino and contributors. GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1.
  https://github.com/arduino/ArduinoCore-avr
  Precompiled for real build (rt/avr/avr-sdk.tar.gz); sources of core and
  libraries are inside that archive.

Bootloaders of Arduino AVR core 1.8.6: Optiboot (Peter Knight, Bill
Westfield), ATmegaBOOT (Arduino), stk500v2 (Peter Fleury, Mark Sproul)
  GNU General Public License 2.
  Their .hex files are merged into ".hex with bootloader" files, as Arduino
  IDE does. Sources: https://github.com/arduino/ArduinoCore-avr/tree/1.8.6/bootloaders

LLVM / Clang 21
  LLVM project. Apache License 2.0 with LLVM exceptions.
  https://llvm.org
YoWASP build of LLVM for WebAssembly (rt/clang.js, rt/llvm*.gz)
  whitequark and contributors. ISC license.
  https://github.com/YoWASP/clang

GCC 7.3.0 (avr-gcc of Arduino toolchain 7.3.0-atmel3.6.1-arduino7)
  Free Software Foundation. GNU General Public License 3; libgcc with GCC
  Runtime Library Exception 3.1 (code of libgcc linked into sketch may be
  used under any terms).
GNU Binutils 2.26 (avr-as, avr-ld, avr-ar, avr-nm, avr-objcopy, avr-size)
  Free Software Foundation. GNU General Public License 3.
  Built for WebAssembly (rt/avr/*.wasm.gz) from Arduino toolchain sources
  (https://github.com/arduino/toolchain-avr, Atmel 3.6.1 patches) with
  WASI patches of Web FastLED. Complete corresponding source of these
  WebAssembly builds (upstream sources, patches, build scripts) is available
  from the author on request, for at least three years from distribution.

avr-libc 2.0.0 (with Arduino patch: malloc margin)
  avr-libc developers. Modified BSD license.
  https://github.com/avrdudes/avr-libc

avr8js 0.21
  Uri Shaked and contributors. MIT license.
  https://github.com/wokwi/avr8js
  Bundled as web/js/avr8.js (emulator of Real CPU timing).

CodeMirror 6
  Marijn Haverbeke and contributors. MIT license.
  https://codemirror.net
  Bundled as web/js/editor.js.

Color themes
  Palettes of Visual Studio Code themes Dark+, Light+, High Contrast
  (Microsoft, MIT license), Monokai, Solarized (Ethan Schoonover, MIT license).

Library samples (repo/, separate package)
  GyverMatrixOS (AlexGyver) and Soulmate sketches belong to their authors.
